Sage grouse compensatory mitigation-
SF0179
amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Barlow and Representative(s) Angelos and
Williams
AN ACT relating to sage grouse implementation and mitigation credits; specifying
that operator-offered mitigation measures may be used and approved to address
impacts to greater sage-grouse habitat; specifying that eminent domain shall
not be used to provide for mitigation activities; requiring rulemaking; and
providing for an effective date.
